# Firebase UID of the parent account whose data the unattended wall-tablet
# board (visiting the site with ?board=1) attempts to read and write without
# signing in. Find it in Firebase Console -> Authentication -> Users ->
# "User UID" column.
#
# SECURITY NOTE (Phase 0 remediation, 2026-09): firestore.rules no longer
# grants unauthenticated access to this UID's data, so the board route is
# currently non-functional (it will show a permission-denied message) until
# a secure kiosk-auth mechanism is designed. This variable is no longer used
# to log anyone into the main app — real Firebase Auth (Google/email) or the
# explicit no-account guest mode is the only way in there.
#
# For local dev: copy this file to .env.local and fill in the real value
# (.env.local is gitignored, so it stays out of version control).
#
# For production (Vercel): add VITE_FAMILY_UID as an Environment Variable in
# your Vercel project settings (Project -> Settings -> Environment Variables),
# then redeploy.
VITE_FAMILY_UID=
